      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-403-414"><seg source="#source-403-414">○</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-414-511"><seg source="#source-414-477">文開く衣の袖はぬれにけり　海より深き　君が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-477-507"><rb>美心</rb><rt>（まごころ）</rt></ruby></p>
      <p source="#source-511-605"><seg source="#source-511-605">世の人はわれをなにともゆはゞいへわがなすことはわれのみぞしる</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-605-687"><seg source="#source-605-687">春くれて五月まつ間のほととぎす初音をしのべ深山べの里</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-687-707"><seg source="#source-687-707">湊川にて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-707-783"><seg source="#source-707-783">月と日のむかしをしのぶみなと川流れて清き菊の下水</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-783-803"><seg source="#source-783-803">明石にて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-803-916"><seg source="#source-803-827">うき事を独明しの</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-830-881"><seg source="#source-827-830">旅</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-851-866">（枕脱カ）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-881-916">磯うつ浪もあわれとぞ聞</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-916-927"><seg source="#source-916-927">○</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-927-996"><seg source="#source-927-996">人心けふやきのふとかわる世に独なげきのます鏡哉</seg></p>
    </body>
